# mobile-backend conventions

- Build with `make build`, test with `make test` (run `make db-up` first), lint with `make lint`.
- Run `make sqlc` after editing files in `internal/db/queries/`.
- Go 1.21. Do not use features from later versions.
- Handlers in `internal/api/` call services in `internal/service/`, never the DB package.
- SQL only in `internal/db/queries/`; never edit `internal/db/gen/`.
- Wrap errors with `%w`.
- Money is integer cents.
- Never log request bodies. They contain PII and the logs are shipped to a third party.
